<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105627" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόχισκ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), ὁ, 
			Dim. of
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροχός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>small wheel</i> or
				<i>circle,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mech.</u>
				848a25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Apollod.
				<u>Poliorc.</u>
				155.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>troche</i> or <i>trochisk,</i> of honey, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				831b27
			</span></i>; of soap, medicine, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.9.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.24.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				2.41
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.276
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>ear-ring,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				16.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>a metal ball,</i> let fall to mark time, <i><span class="en">
				Lyd.
				<u>Mag.</u>
				2.16
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
